<div class="section" id="section-one">
<h1><a class="toc-backref" href="#table-of-contents">Section One</a></h1>
<p>Paragraph with <em>emphasis</em>, <strong>strong</strong>, <tt class="docutils literal">literal</tt>, <cite>interpreted</cite>,
<sub>sub</sub> and <sup>sup</sup> text, a <a class="reference external" href="https://example.org/">reference</a><a class="footnote-reference" href="#footnote-4" id="footnote-reference-6"><sup>4</sup></a>, an <a class="reference external" href="https://example.org/anon">anonymous one</a><a class="footnote-reference" href="#footnote-5" id="footnote-reference-7"><sup>5</sup></a>, a
footnote<a class="footnote-reference" href="#footnote-1" id="footnote-reference-1"><sup>1</sup></a>, an auto footnote<a class="footnote-reference" href="#footnote-2" id="footnote-reference-2"><sup>2</sup></a>, labeled<a class="footnote-reference" href="#lbl" id="footnote-reference-3"><sup>3</sup></a>, symbol<a class="footnote-reference" href="#footnote-3" id="footnote-reference-4"><sup>*</sup></a> and a
citation <a class="citation-reference" href="#cit2002" id="citation-reference-1">[CIT2002]</a>.  Inline <span class="target" id="target">target</span> here; replaced <em>text</em> too.  Standalone
<a class="reference external" href="https://example.org/x?y=1#z">https://example.org/x?y=1#z</a> and <a class="reference external" href="mailto:me&#37;&#52;&#48;example&#46;org">mailto:me<span>&#64;</span>example<span>&#46;</span>org</a>, <a class="reference external" href="mailto:me&#37;&#52;&#48;example&#46;org">me<span>&#64;</span>example<span>&#46;</span>org</a>.</p>
